      claude: `Act as a debugging coach. Define the complete debugging prompt: full error verbatim (stack traces are structured data), the exact code with matching line numbers, expected versus actual behavior, prior attempts, and environment when relevant. Explain why paraphrased errors ('something about a hook') produce generic answers, and the root-cause-before-fix discipline. Under 16 lines.`,
      chatgpt: `When my code has an error I paste it into the AI but the answers are always generic - like it is guessing. Am I pasting the wrong thing? Should I include the whole file? There is a lot of red text in the terminal - do I paste all of it or just the last line?`,
