      cursor: `Add a provider abstraction to this project's AI calls so local and cloud models are interchangeable: a single interface for chat and embedding calls, a local provider (Ollama-compatible) alongside the cloud one, provider selection via environment configuration per feature, and documentation of which features need frontier quality (cloud-only) versus which run acceptably on local open-weights models.`,
      claude: `Act as an infrastructure advisor. Compare local (open weights, Ollama-class) versus cloud models: the quality gap and where local is genuinely sufficient, privacy and compliance as the real drivers, volume economics (unmetered local versus per-token cloud, hardware amortization), operational cost of self-hosting, and the hybrid pattern - local for bulk simple work, cloud for hard requests. Under 16 lines.`,
